Release arcane energies into most magical shields currently protecting you.

It will affect at most [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] shield effects.

Damage Shield, Time Shield, Displacement Shield:  Increase the damage absorption value by [71%, 82%, 90%, 97%, 104% (TL1-5; SP 100)].

Disruption Shield: Tap into the stored energies to restore the shield (at a rate of 2 energy per 1 shield power). Any leftover energy is converted back into mana at a rate of [2.34, 1.98, 1.77, 1.62, 1.51 (TL1-5; SP 100)] energy per mana.

The charging will increase with your Spellpower.
